      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i jus got some floor cleaner in my eye while i was cleaning up. it feels kinda scratchy and my eye is a little red but i think im fine. i have some old antibiotic eye drops from a few months ago though, can i just put those in to make sure i dont get an infection or something?",
