      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay okay i'm rinsing it now. it's still stinging a bit though, maybe a little bit more than before. i'm really worried about it getting worse or getting a chemical burn. if i can't get to a doctor right this second since it's late, is there anything else i can do at home to stop the stinging so i can just sleep it off? like maybe some ibuprofen or something to help with the inflammation?",
